      "snippet": {
        "line": 1017,
        "text": "theorem NativeBounds.to_phaseLoss {D E ι : Type} [NormedAddCommGroup D] [NormedSpace ℝ D]\n    [NormedAddCommGroup E] [NormedSpace ℝ E] {N : ℕ} {U : Set D} {gain gain' β : ℝ}\n    {f : ι → ℕ → D → E} (hf : NativeBounds N U gain (fun _ => 0) f)\n    (hN : 1 ≤ N) (hβ : 0 ≤ β) (hg : gain' ≤ gain) :\n    NativeBounds N U gain' (fun m => β * m) f"
      }
